                  "content": "NEW primitives  alpha.neutral-950-a50 #09090B80 · alpha.black-a60 #00000099 · red.300 #FCA5A5\nNEW semantic    overlay.scrim  L neutral-950-a50 · D black-a60\n                status.danger.solid-hover  L red.700 · D red.300\nmodal.scrim            → overlay.scrim\nmodal.background       → surface.panel\nmodal.title            → text.primary      (title 18/700)\nmodal.description      → text.secondary    (body-sm 13)\nmodal.body.gap         → space.4   16\nmodal.footer.gap       → space.3   12\nbutton.danger.background(-hover) → status.danger.solid(-hover)\nbutton.danger.text     → status.danger.on-solid\nshadow: elevation.2 (existing, 'Dialog/sheet')",
