                  "content": "modal.radius           → radius.xl   24 (= Bottom Sheet)\nmodal.border           → L transparent · D border.default\nmodal.padding          → space.6  24\nmodal.gap              → space.5  20  (header ↔ body ↔ footer)\nmodal.icon.size 40 (literal)\nmodal.icon.background  → status.<tone>.bg\nmodal.icon.fg          → status.<tone>.fg\n≈ 19 tokens total\nConfirm: buttons fill equally; Form: right-aligned",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
                  "fontSize": 11
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
