                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "sheet.inset            → space.2  8  (sides + above home bar)\nsheet.border           → L none · D border.default\nsheet.padding          → space.5  20  (action list: space.2 8)\nsheet.gap              → space.4  16\nsheet.item.radius      → radius.md 12\nsheet.item.background-hover → surface.sunken\nsheet.option.radius    → radius.lg 16\nsheet.cancel           = separate card, same tokens\n≈ 17 tokens · iOS-like; differs from Modal A (no dividers)",
