          "fill": "#1F1E1C",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "PROPOSED TOKENS  ·  size.rail 72 (A) or 88 (B) + component.rail.width → size.rail; A: rail.item.size 40 literal, tooltip → surface.inverse / text.inverse (new component tokens tooltip.background/text); B: reuses bottom-nav.item.* and bottom-nav.cta.*, popover = Menu (C10). Breakpoints: < 768 Mobile App Shell · 768–1279 rail · ≥ 1280 Sidebar.",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
          "fontSize": 12
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "vpLIA",
          "name": "Decision",
          "fill": "#B45309",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "DECISION  ·  PENDING Owner: A or B. Recommendation: A — same destinations and look as the desktop Sidebar (a collapsed state, not a new navigation model), fits every Sidebar item without a “Lainnya” step; B matches the phone but hides five destinations behind a popover.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
          "fontSize": 12
        }
      ]
